{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102751","id":2330660908,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6K6xAs","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102751","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102751.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102751.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102751","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102751/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102751/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102751/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/ce2c38602a13703eb5fef8ac83fb228e7b45cff3","number":102751,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Improve 3D editor's preview sun and environment UX","user":{"login":"MajorMcDoom","id":13228932,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMjI4OTMy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13228932?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom","html_url":"https://github.com/MajorMcDoom","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MajorMcDoom/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This PR aims to make some improvements to the preview sun and preview environment (henceforth called preview sun/env) for the 3D editor.\r\n### Project Defaults\r\nPreviously, users would have no choice in what preview sun/env were applied to new scenes. This is problematic because art direction and graphics needs differ between projects, so having every scene preview by default with glow and color correction enabled creates error-prone workflows where artists cannot see a correct \"neutral\". It is also tedious to change every scene by hand. This PR adds project settings which allow the user to edit the default values for preview sun/env settings.\r\n\r\n![Screenshot 2025-02-12 021429](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4435fb17-37ca-4bfc-beb9-b3eb126d1cd0)\r\n### Shadow Toggle\r\nFor projects that do not use shadows, it was previously _impossible_ to disable shadows for the preview sun. As before, this is problematic because it does not allow the user to edit props or objects in a correct neutral _for their game_. This PR adds a toggle for shadows.\r\n### Revert Buttons\r\nPreviously, it was impossible to quickly revert to default preview settings, meaning the user had to not only remember what the defaults are, but also manually enter them. This PR adds revert buttons at the top of each of the preview sun/env sections.\r\n\r\n![Untitled-1](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/710188f0-9001-4abe-b703-7fa6d121f67f)\r\n### Other Fixes\r\n- Previously, when a new scene was created, the last known state of preview sun/env (from whatever other scene was visited last) was carried over into the new scene. This is arbitrary and error-prone. This PR makes it so that new scenes get the default preview settings applied.\r\n- Previously, the glow button state was not always correctly set in some cases. This PR handles them.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aa